{"4281380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crazy Qualle", "steam_appid": 4281380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Crazy Qualle, the battle game that takes place in the fictional world of Qualle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each map, different weapons fall from the sky. You need to pick them up and then throw them at other players. The player with the most Kills wins the game, but dying will cost you 1 kill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Many Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a lot of maps to choose from! From the old Qualle map to even a haunted house! There is a lot to discover in Crazy Qualle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play over LAN with your friends and family, or you can play against bots by having only yourself join, but that isn't as fun, is it?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Crazy Qualle, the battle game that takes place in the fictional world of Qualle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each map, different weapons fall from the sky. You need to pick them up and then throw them at other players. The player with the most Kills wins the game, but dying will cost you 1 kill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Many Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a lot of maps to choose from! From the old Qualle map to even a haunted house! There is a lot to discover in Crazy Qualle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play over LAN with your friends and family, or you can play against bots by hav